            "review_title": "Review at Dmyna Restaurant & Sky Bar",
            "review_text": "Duong N\n1 contribution\n0\nDO NOT ENTER THIS RESTAURANT EVER. We are family from Australia visiting Vietnam and the kids was craving Western food\nApr 2026 • Family\nIt’s a disaster visit. We were hungry, tired and craving Western food. But all we saw was a kid service in front and he was not very responsive ( even though I spoke Vietnamese as my mother language). We order hamburgers and took 30mins after he took order to say they didn’t have it available. Then we order the pasta which Mac&cheese and salmon spaghetti. Then another 15mins came the “spaghetti and runny powder cheese liquid” and “ runny creamy salmon spaghetti “. Nothing like the menu’s photos. Even the beer was not filling in full. Such a waste of money. When we asked the boy that they were not what we ordered. He called the boss and replied us that they only serve like that in there place. Just not come\nRead more\nWritten April 23, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
